acceptance:
A source file in a session whose watched root is itself a .tmp/wt-* worktree is still observed and attributed. Existing tests that asserted observation of nested .tmp worktrees from the main checkout are CHANGED to assert rejection, each one named with this contract change as its justification.
(a) a named-root source edit is attributed;
(b) a gate-root source edit during a carried gate still fences credit;
(c) .tmp scratch inside a named root is dropped;
(d) an unrelated nested worktree under main's .tmp stays unobserved.
